{%- comment -%}
  Karthika category icon placeholder — inline SVG, no external requests.
  Every known product type maps to a meaningful small icon path.
  Unknown types fall back to a generic grocery-basket icon.

  Accepts : product_type (string)
  Outputs : a data: URI safe for <img src="...">

  Palette  : pale mint #EEF7E8 bg, sage ring #C8E6B8, dark green #2D6A1F icon
             (matches Karthika brand; slightly warmer tones for food variety)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign _t = product_type | default: '' | strip | upcase
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  Each icon is a compact SVG path drawn on a 80×80 canvas.
  We encode it as a partial URL-encoded fragment then compose the full URI at the end.
  All paths use stroke-based icons (stroke-width ~3, linecap round, linejoin round)
  on a pale mint background circle, matching the Karthika sidebar aesthetic.

  BG circle colour: #EEF7E8 (pale mint)
  Icon stroke colour: #2D6A1F (dark Karthika green)
  Stroke-width: 3
{%- endcomment -%}

